# ─── Phase 1 — Public Frontend ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No environment variables are required for the frontend-only phase.
# All content is served from local data files in /src/data/.

# ─── Phase 4 — Backend Integration ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment and set when connecting to the Express backend.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com/api

# ─── Notes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# - Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_ to the client bundle.
# - Never put secrets, tokens or private keys in VITE_ variables.
# - Backend secrets (JWT_SECRET, DB_URI, etc.) live only in the server .env.
